        "event_id": "lite_evt_00533",
        "explanation": "Family receipt confirms they are home, have reconciled discharge documents and medication boxes, and will not self-adjust.",
        "quote": "今晚就按那个执行"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode reached safe bounded closure after hospital evaluation, written discharge/medication reconciliation, family confirmation, and a home monitoring plus emergency-return plan. Residual tea-red urine was bounded by preserved urination, absence of red flags, written follow-up for renal/electrolyte/urine testing and urine culture, and explicit instructions not to guess or self-adjust medicines.",
